There is more than one artist with this name, including: 
1) Bully is the solo project of American singer, songwriter and guitarist Alicia Bognanno that originally began as a rock band, formed in 2013 in Nashville, TN; 
2) Bully is an American Southern/Blues/Stoner Rock band; 
3) Bully is an American hardcore punk band from Enumclaw, Washington; 
4) Bully is an American hard-rock band from Virginia Beach formed in 2002. 

